SUMMARY:Roller Blading at Overpeck Park Leonia
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nRollerska
 te/Rollerblade/Walk with us while we rollerblade and roller skate around a
  beautiful Park. This event is outdoors and you should bring your own roll
 er blades or skates. If you do not have them feel free to walk along with 
 us.\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/2mjgC66MFgnfyRmU8
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314836641/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T221218Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T221218Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314836673@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T180000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Sundays at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Mikey/Michael. Join us as we play for fun & just make friend
 s! We'll have 2 Pro Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson Pro ball.\nIt's not on 41 Will
 ow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ.\nThe court is open to the public and if it hap
 pens to be taken\, we may play with those already playing initially\, or w
 e will move to the grass since we have a Volleyball NET!\n\nIf you have fu
 n and would like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Vol
 leyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/15873146859
 75434)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/2mjgC66MFgnfyRmU8
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314836673/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T221834Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T221834Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314931267@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T170000
SUMMARY:Food Truck Fest - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is foo
 d truck festival time.\n\nJoin us at JC’s Annual Montvale “Mile Long
 ” Street Fair & Food Truck Fest.\n\n1 p.m. June 14.\n\n101 Paragon Drive
  Montvale NJ 07645\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp grou
 p chat and Jackie\, one of our event regulars.\n\nWe'll share more details
  as we get closer to the date.\n\nHere are some event links:\n\nhttps://jc
 promotions.info/product/jcs-annual-montvale-mile-long-street-fair-food-tru
 ck-fest/\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/837384746049259\n\nQuestions o
 r comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9
 609. Check out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other 
 activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball\n\nIf
  interested in staying touch with group members or conversing about future
  events\, feel free to inquire about our WhatsApp group chat.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314931267/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260524T055432Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260524T055432Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315180200@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T220000
SUMMARY:BVT goes to Mitsuwa!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nYou read 
 it right!\n\nBVT goes to Mitsuwa!\nAs with traditional work weeks\, people
  might usually feel like there's a mountain climb to reach Friday\, or in 
 most cases at least Thursday.\n\nThis time around\, BVT will look to make 
 everyone's work week that much more less of a drag with a nuanced event ce
 ntered around Japanese culture\, food\, and much more.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315180200/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T064532Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T064532Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314238854@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T220000
SUMMARY:Ping Pong Party - North Jersey 
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nWe're a g
 roup of people who will casually hit the ball around and rotate playing to
  10 or 15 points for two to three hours. If there's an interest\, we may d
 o king of the hill\, round robin\, a small tournament or some other organi
 zed game.\n\nAll are welcome!! It's just casual fun! Come anytime! We're n
 ot in a league and are not here to analyze your form.\n\nWe'll be heading 
 indoors to the table tennis tables at Ready to Golf\, 3 New Bridge Road in
  River Edge. We'll likely have pizza delivered or hang out some more at Co
 ach House Diner\, 55 Rte 4 in Hackensack.\n\nReady to Golf has a lot to of
 fer\, including rentable table tennis tables\, and comes as a recommendati
 on of Joe\, one of our many regulars.\n\nWe'll be reserving six tables for
  singles and doubles play but we may get more if they're available and if 
 more than 30 people show up.\n\nThe rental price covers paddles and balls.
  Final pricing will be somewhere in the neighborhood of $10-15 per person.
  Please bring cash to pay for what you owe! We'll settle the bill before p
 lay.\n\nFor planning purposes\, we also ask that if you're stopping by lat
 er than 8 p.m.\, that you please let me know by commenting below\, or call
 ing or texting me.\n\nThere is a snack bar on site\, but it's only open un
 til 7:30 p.m. There are some bottled drinks available and a water fountain
 \, but you're welcome to bring food and beverages from the outside. It's B
 YOB friendly. There's also plenty of seating and space for hanging out on 
 the side when not playing and some televisions with sports programming.\n\
 nIf interested in learning more about the place\, here's the website: www.
 readytogolf.com\n\nHope you'll join us for our sixth ping pong event. Ques
 tions\, comments\, concerns or having trouble finding us? You can message 
 Andy Milone on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nIf interested
 \, check out one of our many other events. We do bowling\, volleyball\, te
 nnis\, soccer\, hiking\, martial arts\, billiards\, dancing and bar crawls
 : [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meet
 up.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314238854/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260412T021949Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T021949Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
