DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T200000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball June20th 1-8pm Watchung Res & BBQ!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll k
 eep score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where you must
  serve to score! Games will be to 25. No kicking\, no using your head.\nWe
 'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nWe have our own Volleyball NET\,
  poles\, & ropes!\n**There's a fire pit so we always cook & have a barbecu
 e.**\nI bring the firewood\, utentils\, cookware\, pans\, & sometimes hotd
 ogs/buns. Please bring some snacks\, food\, or drinks or ice to share if y
 ou can.\nIf you have fun and would like to play with us at other locations
 \, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook
 .com/groups/1587314685975434)\nPost in FB Group what you will bring so eve
 ryone knows.\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/w8ZFJhe6s4GBLF24A
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315250665/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260614T031534Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260614T031534Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314356841@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044911Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T180000
SUMMARY:Adult Kickball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nCome join
  us for two to three hours of adult kickball at a local park.\n\nThe event
  is tentatively scheduled for Columbus Park\, 71 W Franklin St\, Hackensac
 k\, because it has a huge grass field.\n\nWe'll grab a kickball\, some bas
 es and split up into teams to play. Comment below if you have your own to 
 bring. There are a ton of parking spaces on West Franklin Street.\n\n\\*\\
 *\\* After playing\, we'll likely be heading to Tropical Juice Bar\, 60 Ri
 ver St.\, Hackensack. Feel free to suggest another spot to hang out. \\*\\
 *\\*\n\nThere's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides sho
 w up. Come anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not 
 here to analyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in mon
 ths\, maybe years\, and just want to play again and hang out.\n\nHope you'
 ll join us for our second kickball event. Questions or comments? You can m
 essage Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\nCheck out bowli
 ng\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis\, skating or one of our other activities
  at: [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.m
 eetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314356841/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260419T002200Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260419T002200Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
